# Case: Native Wayland quick-panel Copy fallback
# Mode: native
# Environment: disposable-guest
# Purpose: Verify understandable automatic-paste refusal, preserved Copy and physical Escape dismissal on Wayland.
# Steps:
#   Open the production panel from settings, attempt Enter, copy through Ctrl+C, reopen and dismiss through Escape.
# Expected:
#   The panel falls back to Copy without an inline alert banner; Enter leaves the clipboard unchanged; Copy applies exact bytes; Escape hides the panel without changing the clipboard.
# Forbidden:
#   Synthetic target capture authority, automatic paste claims, portal approval claims or host clipboard access.

system-board-write 'UNIC-D panel baseline'
start
submit panel 'UNIC-D panel copy 中文'
ui-wait listItem 'UNIC-D panel copy 中文'
ui-click listItem 设置…
ui-wait listItem 快捷面板
ui-click listItem 快捷面板
ui-wait button 打开快捷面板
ui-click button 打开快捷面板
system-window 'unic · 快捷面板' visible
ui-wait text 复制到剪贴板
ui-absent alert '~.*'
screenshot wayland-copy-fallback
system-key Enter
system-board-equals 'UNIC-D panel baseline'
system-key Ctrl+C
system-board-equals 'UNIC-D panel copy 中文'
system-window 'unic · 快捷面板' hidden
system-window unic visible
ui-click button 打开快捷面板
system-window 'unic · 快捷面板' visible
system-key Escape
system-window 'unic · 快捷面板' hidden
system-board-equals 'UNIC-D panel copy 中文'
system-window unic visible
history-count 1
screenshot panel-dismissed
